  "title": "The far-side map",
  "status": "Proved",
  "claim": "The far-side map (computed on the 191 exact creation maps of GLUE-READ B: 111 census spaces and 80 random spaces with plane glue). The Fano plane and census 58 create at exactly the same pairs; K4^(3) creates only where census 6 does; and census 6 creates without the Fano plane only when the gluing line is a glue line. So at an atom line creation is one of four strengths: none, by the Fano plane and census 58, with census 6 too, or with all four. Every Fano atom acts as one from outside: every atom line outside it receives the same far-side vector from each of its lines (731 of 731 atoms), although its lines differ in what they do to glue lines and in what they receive.",
